ator":"a5d4764001db3a30166d16c9a49006c23b61b9fd274357ea37a40b0890b7502b","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"9b3fee0cbbd72b4bc37c643d989d7e839a059fff750f41f9b152727129f0c3ae","logical_entry_identity":"98432c321efa1681c108d71ea87fee7c20c569765aaa57fb675abb27307341fd","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Strength, +4 Dexterity, +1 Constitution","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 力量，+4 敏捷，+1 体质"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6309cac3631f6e1b60524b69cfc6d9ac2b2b45322f6d11a94aeec1de047103de","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"9b478777372577c154fa7030b1c32c228f374b9979aca0c7f390805d18e8c7c9","logical_entry_identity":"1a7dedfd85773f20e2edfd5c955f256e50466bb43d00a57511e500e4f30e2490","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Strikes can trigger a thunderclap that damages and repel foes.","source_tag":"_t","target":"攻击能触发雷电，伤害并击退敌人。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2235bc3647ddbb5e0935b6da1fc1fc89433de0a109f0da3d02a0a509e0b6bc48","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"9b65c2f6025aaa35ce98e06785bd344225978fb420f9fe596fb644f3f7995774","logical_entry_identity":"cf2a3d73c8a671b11467dfc6040f5c33f9d018bd70ffd5dfb3c1749ce29ed65a","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"+Smoke Cover","source_tag":"_t","target":"+烟雾覆盖"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e14a487cd5aad92224b65b4dca8b156912df14a352777761684c18d5d1103d0d","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"9b6dcd1b9c7d9896afc3e80f14569d58505373579def02704fd984c607132021","logical_entry_identity":"6fcdd95ad2ffbd90536cb462bfa484da8c6bf4e502084c29b2c5fc4594353c42","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Using your sheer arcane power you keep breaches in spacetime open for %d turns.\n\t\tEach turn they are open you project an occult clone of your saw along each breach, damaging any creature caught for %d%% occult weapon damage.\n\t\tThe saw cuts both in a physical and arcane way, reducing the duration of a random beneficial effect on each target by %d each time.\n\t\tEach target can only be affected once per turn.\n\t\tThis spell is only usable for one turn after casting Reality Breach but any Reality Breach cast during its duration is also recorded inside.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你调动强大的奥术力量，在时空中切开的裂缝会保持开放，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t在这一裂缝打开的每一回合里，从裂缝中会投射一个你链锯的玄机克隆，对所有击中的生物造成 %d%% 玄机武器伤害。\n\t\t这一链锯会在物理和奥术的意义上切裂敌人，每次击中会降低目标身上一个随机增益效果的持续时间 %d 回合。\n\t\t每个目标每回合只会被这一效果影响一次。\n\t\t此法术只能在施放现实切裂后的下一回合使用，但它持续期间施放的任何现实切裂也会被记录其中。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"65adde94bcf141754e5214864a92213eb84df8765ac7a39ff63ee53ae427fe52","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"9b8003dd1ec26f95d00fe6a4310159cb653b4aac66b5e0557c06dfeaa5612630","logical_entry_identity":"802d89c79d0a8542383617d8eea34f316fd7968b8dfadfd76fa5e06552f666aa","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Powerful psionics are able to enter a gestalt with steam generators and technology to enhance their own mental prowess.","source_tag":"_t","target":"强大的灵能使用者能够与蒸汽发生器和科技形成格式塔联结，以增强自身的精神力量。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f1fdf5c148e8038b101196269e8b9356368cc7bec7b0cf110e448fc78214f772","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"9b9a88a1a7930336b88e9f0ed3d88b33c7da1ccf7b0f9f5f2adf14b868276f2e","logical_entry_identity":"cacf80270bfa0390db7bc861e645e011e4e7656530f1c424ecc163800cc2f767","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"mecharachnid","source_tag":"_t","target":"机械蜘蛛"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"08016f6aec820265c295ae3ed43ad9958d83673a169e241ff544ca3b99bebe82","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"9ba2e7a40d249a2ec6c69ca00391e32f77637ccaa71dee0aa1c32ef688f7e8ef","logical_entry_identity":"9a868032f0baf23e37971c774837362b94607cb4cb9ee7cb3554b4130787b019","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You strike the target with your tailsaw for %d%% damage. If this hits, you attempt to clamp them with your pincers for %d turns. This pins, reduces their attack, spell and mind speed by %d%%, and lets you make a free, unavoidable strike with your tailsaw against them each turn for %d%% damage. This ends if you move more than 1 tile from the target.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你用尾部蒸汽链锯攻击目标，造成 %d%% 伤害。若命中，你会尝试用钳爪将目标钳制 %d 回合，使其定身，并使其攻击、法术和精神速度降低 %d%%。在此期间，你每回合都会用尾部蒸汽链锯对其发动一次额外且无法闪避的攻击，造成 %d%% 伤害。若你与目标的距离超过 1 格，该效果结束。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e569cc5215f1f74a99b22c88c15edc75a9b51316792bd6892c191f992f005c12","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"9c020c21838c8900f40e88f2bee3f3c12fcf9f4eec2700cd28435c87d2a46537","logical_entry_identity":"403f011de378cff917eaff867b0e02b81d2cc9d9c3b9cec5395cc531db91ac8a","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You have found extremely old machines powered by advanced psionics and technology. Psionics without a living mind was never thought possible.\nYou can now create new characters with the #LIGHT_GREEN#Psyshot class#WHITE#.\n\nPsyshots are Tinkers that merge psionics and steamtech in a lethal blend, wielding a steamgun in one hand and a mindstar in the other.\nClass features:#YELLOW#\n- Project mindstar attacks with each bullet you fire\n- Inspire dread to weaken your foes to your gunslinging\n- Manipulate the very air around your victims\n- Enter a psionic gestalt with your steam generators, boosting them#WHITE#\n\nAll Tinker classes use Steam for their powers.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"你找到了一些由先进灵能与科技驱动的极其古老的机器。没有生命心智的灵能从未被认为可能存在。\n现在你可以在创建人物时选择新的职业：#LIGHT_GREEN#灵能射手#WHITE#。\n\n灵能射手是融合灵能与蒸汽科技、形成致命组合的工匠职业，一手持蒸汽枪一手持灵晶。\n职业特色：#YELLOW#\n- 将灵晶的攻击投射到你发射的子弹中。\n- 激发敌人的恐惧，让敌人在你的枪法前无处遁形。\n- 操纵你的受害者身边的空气。\n- 与你的蒸汽发生器进入灵能格式塔，从而强化它们。#WHITE#\n\n所有工匠系职业使用蒸汽作为能量。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"49e4bba0a0aac2d849b448525fdf815425da83549bc666d9179babc9df2bddd8","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"9c1aa7fdf80d53521ff3c1983ab38c203f81d5cb9b3828d30dc82b6f9dcd983a","logical_entry_identity":"043ee00dc0b0b41aed03fcdc8a7fb4c3faa1ff0e9ce7e2a02021a5ded490843f","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Requires ingredients:","source_tag":"_t